{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic\/color","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"color","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLHarmonicV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","text":"MXLColor"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlharmonic\/color"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","title":"MXLColor","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLHarmonic":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlharmonic","title":"MXLHarmonic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLHarmonic"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLHarmonic"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The harmonic type indicates natural and artificial harmonics. Allowing the type of pitch to be specified,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"combined with controls for appearance\/playback differences, allows both the notation and the sound to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"represented. Artificial harmonics can add a notated touching pitch; artificial pinch harmonics will usually"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not notate a touching pitch. The attributes for the harmonic element refer to the use of the circular harmonic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"symbol, typically but not always used with natural harmonics."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLHarmonic/color":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarmonic\/color","type":"topic","title":"color","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlharmonic\/color","kind":"symbol"}}}